    {
      "tipo": "contenido",
      "titulo": "Tema 4 · Términos algebraicos",
      "html": "<p class='text-lg'>En un término algebraico identificamos signo, coeficiente numérico sin signo, variables, exponentes y grado. El grado de un término con varias variables es la suma de sus exponentes; una constante distinta de cero tiene grado 0. El grado de un polinomio es el mayor grado de sus términos.</p><p class='text-lg mt-3'>Ejemplos de términos algebraicos:</p><div style='display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0.75rem;justify-content:center;margin:0.75rem 0;'><span style='display:inline-block;background-color:rgba(245,158,11,0.2);border:1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.5);border-radius:0.375rem;padding:0.5rem 1rem;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-weight:600;font-size:1.125rem;' class='text-slate-900 dark:text-white'>−5x²</span><span style='display:inline-block;background-color:rgba(59,130,246,0.2);border:1px solid rgba(59,130,246,0.5);border-radius:0.375rem;padding:0.5rem 1rem;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-weight:600;font-size:1.125rem;' class='text-slate-900 dark:text-white'>3ab</span><span style='display:inline-block;background-color:rgba(16,185,129,0.2);border:1px solid rgba(16,185,129,0.5);border-radius:0.375rem;padding:0.5rem 1rem;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-weight:600;font-size:1.125rem;' class='text-slate-900 dark:text-white'>−11</span><span style='display:inline-block;background-color:rgba(139,92,246,0.2);border:1px solid rgba(139,92,246,0.5);border-radius:0.375rem;padding:0.5rem 1rem;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-weight:600;font-size:1.125rem;' class='text-slate-900 dark:text-white'>−9z³</span><span style='display:inline-block;background-color:rgba(236,72,153,0.2);border:1px solid rgba(236,72,153,0.5);border-radius:0.375rem;padding:0.5rem 1rem;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-weight:600;font-size:1.125rem;' class='text-slate-900 dark:text-white'>8pq²</span><span style='display:inline-block;background-color:rgba(245,158,11,0.2);border:1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.5);border-radius:0.375rem;padding:0.5rem 1rem;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-weight:600;font-size:1.125rem;' class='text-slate-900 dark:text-white'>7r³s</span></div><p class='text-lg'>Según el número de términos, las expresiones se clasifican así:</p><div class='grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2 my-2'><div class='bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/30 p-3 rounded-lg'><p class='text-lg'>Monomio · un término</p><div style='margin:0.75rem 0;text-align:center;'><span style='display:inline-block;background-color:rgba(245,158,11,0.2);border:1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.5);border-radius:0.375rem;padding:0.5rem 1rem;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-weight:600;font-size:1.125rem;' class='text-slate-900 dark:text-white'>−8r⁴</span></div></div><div class='bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/30 p-3 rounded-lg'><p class='text-lg'>Binomio · dos términos</p><div style='margin:0.75rem 0;text-align:center;'><span style='display:inline-block;background-color:rgba(245,158,11,0.2);border:1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.5);border-radius:0.375rem;padding:0.5rem 1rem;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-weight:600;font-size:1.125rem;' class='text-slate-900 dark:text-white'>2p − 9</span></div></div><div class='bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/30 p-3 rounded-lg'><p class='text-lg'>Trinomio · tres términos</p><div style='margin:0.75rem 0;text-align:center;'><span style='display:inline-block;background-color:rgba(245,158,11,0.2);border:1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.5);border-radius:0.375rem;padding:0.5rem 1rem;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-weight:600;font-size:1.125rem;' class='text-slate-900 dark:text-white'>5z² + 3z − 8</span></div></div><div class='bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/30 p-3 rounded-lg'><p class='text-lg'>Polinomio · cuatro términos o más</p><div style='margin:0.75rem 0;text-align:center;'>