    {
      "tipo": "contenido",
      "titulo": "Tema 5 · Lenguaje algebraico: suma",
      "html": "<p class='text-lg'>Las letras representan cantidades desconocidas. “Suma”, “más”, “aumentado”, “añadir”, “incrementar” y “agregar” indican adición; cambiar el orden de los sumandos no altera el resultado.</p><div class='grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2 my-2'><div class='bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/30 p-3 rounded-lg'><p class='text-lg'>“Suma de dos números distintos”</p><div style='margin:0.75rem 0;text-align:center;'><span style='display:inline-block;background-color:rgba(245,158,11,0.2);border:1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.5);border-radius:0.375rem;padding:0.5rem 1rem;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-weight:600;font-size:1.125rem;' class='text-slate-900 dark:text-white'>a + b</span></div></div><div class='bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/30 p-3 rounded-lg'><p class='text-lg'>“Nueve más un número”</p><div style='margin:0.75rem 0;text-align:center;'><span style='display:inline-block;background-color:rgba(245,158,11,0.2);border:1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.5);border-radius:0.375rem;padding:0.5rem 1rem;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-weight:600;font-size:1.125rem;' class='text-slate-900 dark:text-white'>9 + x</span></div></div><div class='bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/30 p-3 rounded-lg'><p class='text-lg'>“Número aumentado en seis”</p><div style='margin:0.75rem 0;text-align:center;'><span style='display:inline-block;background-color:rgba(245,158,11,0.2);border:1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.5);border-radius:0.375rem;padding:0.5rem 1rem;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-weight:600;font-size:1.125rem;' class='text-slate-900 dark:text-white'>x + 6</span></div></div><div class='bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/30 p-3 rounded-lg'><p class='text-lg'>“Añadir ocho a un número”</p><div style='margin:0.75rem 0;text-align:center;'><span style='display:inline-block;background-color:rgba(245,158,11,0.2);border:1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.5);border-radius:0.375rem;padding:0.5rem 1rem;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-weight:600;font-size:1.125rem;' class='text-slate-900 dark:text-white'>x + 8</span></div></div><div class='bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/30 p-3 rounded-lg'><p class='text-lg'>“Incrementar en cuatro”</p><div style='margin:0.75rem 0;text-align:center;'><span style='display:inline-block;background-color:rgba(245,158,11,0.2);border:1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.5);border-radius:0.375rem;padding:0.5rem 1rem;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-weight:600;font-size:1.125rem;' class='text-slate-900 dark:text-white'>x + 4</span></div></div><div class='bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/30 p-3 rounded-lg'><p class='text-lg'>“Agregar cinco a un número”</p><div style='margin:0.75rem 0;text-align:center;'><span style='display:inline-block;background-color:rgba(245,158,11,0.2);border:1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.5);border-radius:0.375rem;padding:0.5rem 1rem;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-weight:600;font-size:1.125rem;' class='text-slate-900 dark:text-white'>x + 5</span></div></div></div>"
    },
    {
      "tipo": "contenido",
      "titulo": "Lenguaje algebraico: resta",
      "html": "<p class='text-lg'>La resta depende del orden: primero identifica la cantidad inicial y luego qué se le quita. “Menos que” suele invertir el orden de las cantidades mencionadas.</p><div class='grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2 my-2'><div class='bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/30 p-3 rounded-lg'><p class='text-lg'>“La diferencia entre dos números”</p><div style='margin:0.75rem 0;text-align:center;'><span style='display:inline-block;background-color:rgba(245,158,11,0.2);border:1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.5);border-radius:0.375rem;padding:0.5rem 1rem;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-weight:600;font-size:1.125rem;' class='text-slate-900 dark:text-white'>x − y</span></div></div><div class='bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/30 p-3 rounded-lg'><p class='text-lg'>“Nueve menos un número”</p><div style='margin:0.75rem 0;text-align:center;'><span style='display:inline-block;background-color:rgba(245,158,11,0.2);border:1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.5);border-radius:0.375rem;padding:0.5rem 1rem;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-weight:600;font-size:1.125rem;' class='text-slate-900 dark:text-white'>9 − x</span></div></div><div class='bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/30 p-3 rounded-lg'><p class='text-lg'>“Siete restado de un número”</p><div style='margin:0.75rem 0;text-align:center;'><span style='display:inline-block;background-color:rgba(245,158,11,0.2);border:1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.5);border-radius:0.375rem;padding:0.5rem 1rem;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-weight:600;font-size:1.125rem;' class='text-slate-900 dark:text-white'>x − 7</span></div></div><div class='bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/30 p-3 rounded-lg'><p class='text-lg'>“Tres menos que un número”</p><div style='margin:0.75rem 0;text-align:center;'><span style='display:inline-block;background-color:rgba(245,158,11,0.2);border:1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.5);border-radius:0.375rem;padding:0.5rem 1rem;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-weight:600;font-size:1.125rem;' class='text-slate-900 dark:text-white'>x − 3</span></div></div><div class='bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/30 p-3 rounded-lg'><p class='text-lg'>“A dos le restas un número”</p><div style='margin:0.75rem 0;text-align:center;'><span style='display:inline-block;background-color:rgba(245,158,11,0.2);border:1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.5);border-radius:0.375rem;padding:0.5rem 1rem;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-weight:600;font-size:1.125rem;' class='text-slate-900 dark:text-white'>2 − x</span></div></div><div class='bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/30 p-3 rounded-lg'><p class='text-lg'>“A cualquier número le quitas ocho”</p><div style='margin:0.75rem 0;text-align:center;'><span style='display:inline-block;background-color:rgba(245,158,11,0.2);border:1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.5);border-radius:0.375rem;padding:0.5rem 1rem;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-weight:600;font-size:1.125rem;' class='text-slate-900 dark:text-white'>x − 8</span></div></div></div>"
    },
    {
      "tipo": "contenido",
      "titulo": "Lenguaje algebraico: multiplicación",
      "html": "<p class='text-lg'>“Producto”, “veces”, “por” y “múltiplo” indican multiplicación. El coeficiente indica cuántas veces se toma la variable; cantidades desconocidas distintas usan letras diferentes.</p><div class='grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2 my-2'><div class='bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/30 p-3 rounded-lg'><p class='text-lg'>“El producto de dos números”</p><div style='margin:0.75rem 0;text-align:center;'><span style='display:inline-block;background-color:rgba(245,158,11,0.2);border:1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.5);border-radius:0.375rem;padding:0.5rem 1rem;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-weight:600;font-size:1.125rem;' class='text-slate-900 dark:text-white'>a · b</span></div></div><div class='bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/30 p-3 rounded-lg'><p class='text-lg'>“Nueve veces un número”</p><div style='margin:0.75rem 0;text-align:center;'><span style='display:inline-block;background-color:rgba(245,158,11,0.2);border:1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.5);border-radius:0.375rem;padding:0.5rem 1rem;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-weight:600;font-size:1.125rem;' class='text-slate-900 dark:text-white'>9x</span></div></div><div class='bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/30 p-3 rounded-lg'><p class='text-lg'>“Seis por un número”</p><div style='margin:0.75rem 0;text-align:center;'><span style='display:inline-block;background-color:rgba(245,158,11,0.2);border:1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.5);border-radius:0.375rem;padding:0.5rem 1rem;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-weight:600;font-size:1.125rem;' class='text-slate-900 dark:text-white'>6x</span></div></div><div class='bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/30 p-3 rounded-lg'><p class='text-lg'>“Un múltiplo de cuatro”</p><div style='margin:0.75rem 0;text-align:center;'><span style='display:inline-block;background-color:rgba(245,158,11,0.2);border:1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.5);border-radius:0.375rem;padding:0.5rem 1rem;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-weight:600;font-size:1.125rem;' class='text-slate-900 dark:text-white'>4x</span></div></div><div class='bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/30 p-3 rounded-lg'><p class='text-lg'>“El doble de un número”</p><div style='margin:0.75rem 0;text-align:center;'><span style='display:inline-block;background-color:rgba(245,158,11,0.2);border:1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.5);border-radius:0.375rem;padding:0.5rem 1rem;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-weight:600;font-size:1.125rem;' class='text-slate-900 dark:text-white'>2x</span></div></div><div class='bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/30 p-3 rounded-lg'><p class='text-lg'>“El triple de un número”</p><div style='margin:0.75rem 0;text-align:center;'><span style='display:inline-block;background-color:rgba(245,158,11,0.2);border:1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.5);border-radius:0.375rem;padding:0.5rem 1rem;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-weight:600;font-size:1.125rem;' class='text-slate-900 dark:text-white'>3x</span></div></div></div>"
    },
    {
      "tipo": "contenido",
      "titulo": "Lenguaje algebraico: división",
      "html": "<p class='text-lg'>“Cociente”, “razón”, “dividido entre” y “entre” indican división. El primer número nombrado es el dividendo y el segundo, el divisor. El divisor no puede ser cero.</p><div class='grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2 my-2'><div class='bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/30 p-3 rounded-lg'><p class='text-lg'>“El cociente de dos números”</p><div style='margin:0.75rem 0;text-align:center;'><span style='display:inline-block;background-color:rgba(245,158,11,0.2);border:1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.5);border-radius:0.375rem;padding:0.5rem 1rem;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-weight:600;font-size:1.125rem;' class='text-slate-900 dark:text-white'>a / b</span></div></div><div class='bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/30 p-3 rounded-lg'><p class='text-lg'>“Un número dividido por siete”</p><div style='margin:0.75rem 0;text-align:center;'><span style='display:inline-block;background-color:rgba(245,158,11,0.2);border:1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.5);border-radius:0.375rem;padding:0.5rem 1rem;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-weight:600;font-size:1.125rem;' class='text-slate-900 dark:text-white'>x / 7</span></div></div><div class='bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/30 p-3 rounded-lg'><p class='text-lg'>“Nueve entre cualquier número”</p><div style='margin:0.75rem 0;text-align:center;'><span style='display:inline-block;background-color:rgba(245,158,11,0.2);border:1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.5);border-radius:0.375rem;padding:0.5rem 1rem;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-weight:600;font-size:1.125rem;' class='text-slate-900 dark:text-white'>9 / x</span></div></div><div class='bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/30 p-3 rounded-lg'><p class='text-lg'>“La razón de dos números”</p><div style='margin:0.75rem 0;text-align:center;'><span style='display:inline-block;background-color:rgba(245,158,11,0.2);border:1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.5);border-radius:0.375rem;padding:0.5rem 1rem;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-weight:600;font-size:1.125rem;' class='text-slate-900 dark:text-white'>x / y</span></div></div><div class='bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/30 p-3 rounded-lg'><p class='text-lg'>“La mitad de un número”</p><div style='margin:0.75rem 0;text-align:center;'><span style='display:inline-block;background-color:rgba(245,158,11,0.2);border:1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.5);border-radius:0.375rem;padding:0.5rem 1rem;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-weight:600;font-size:1.125rem;' class='text-slate-900 dark:text-white'>x / 2</span></div></div><div class='bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/30 p-3 rounded-lg'><p class='text-lg'>“La tercera parte de un número”</p><div style='margin:0.75rem 0;text-align:center;'><span style='display:inline-block;background-color:rgba(245,158,11,0.2);border:1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.5);border-radius:0.375rem;padding:0.5rem 1rem;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-weight:600;font-size:1.125rem;' class='text-slate-900 dark:text-white'>x / 3</span></div></div></div>"
    },
    {
      "tipo": "contenido",
      "titulo": "Lenguaje algebraico: exponentes y potencias",
      "html": "<p class='text-lg'>Una potencia representa una multiplicación repetida. La base es el factor que se repite y el exponente indica cuántas veces aparece como factor.</p><div class='grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2 my-2'><div class='bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/30 p-3 rounded-lg'><p class='text-lg'>“El cuadrado de x”</p><div style='margin:0.75rem 0;text-align:center;'><span style='display:inline-block;background-color:rgba(245,158,11,0.2);border:1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.5);border-radius:0.375rem;padding:0.5rem 1rem;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-weight:600;font-size:1.125rem;' class='text-slate-900 dark:text-white'>x² = x · x</span></div></div><div class='bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/30 p-3 rounded-lg'><p class='text-lg'>“El cubo de y”</p><div style='margin:0.75rem 0;text-align:center;'><span style='display:inline-block;background-color:rgba(245,158,11,0.2);border:1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.5);border-radius:0.375rem;padding:0.5rem 1rem;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-weight:600;font-size:1.125rem;' class='text-slate-900 dark:text-white'>y³ = y · y · y</span></div></div></div><p class='text-lg'>No confundas el cuadrado de un número con su doble: x² = x · x, mientras que 2x = 2 · x. Si la potencia se aplica a una suma completa, usa paréntesis: “el cuadrado de la suma de x y dos” se escribe (x + 2)².</p>"
    },
    {
      "tipo": "contenido",
      "titulo": "Lenguaje algebraico: expresiones compuestas",
      "html": "<p class='text-lg'>Una expresión compuesta combina varias operaciones. Usa paréntesis para agrupar cantidades y mostrar qué operación se realiza primero; cambiar el agrupamiento puede cambiar la expresión.</p><p class='text-lg'>Observa cómo se traducen estas frases:</p><div class='grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2 my-2'><div class='bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/30 p-3 rounded-lg'><p class='text-lg'>“El cuádruple de un número, aumentado en seis”</p><div style='margin:0.75rem 0;text-align:center;'><span style='display:inline-block;background-color:rgba(245,158,11,0.2);border:1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.5);border-radius:0.375rem;padding:0.5rem 1rem;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-weight:600;font-size:1.125rem;' class='text-slate-900 dark:text-white'>4x + 6</span></div></div><div class='bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/30 p-3 rounded-lg'><p class='text-lg'>“El cuádruple de la suma de un número y seis”</p><div style='margin:0.75rem 0;text-align:center;'><span style='display:inline-block;background-color:rgba(245,158,11,0.2);border:1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.5);border-radius:0.375rem;padding:0.5rem 1rem;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-weight:600;font-size:1.125rem;' class='text-slate-900 dark:text-white'>4(x + 6)</span></div></div><div class='bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/30 p-3 rounded-lg'><p class='text-lg'>“El doble de la diferencia entre un número y cinco”</p><div style='margin:0.75rem 0;text-align:center;'><span style='display:inline-block;background-color:rgba(245,158,11,0.2);border:1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.5);border-radius:0.375rem;padding:0.5rem 1rem;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-weight:600;font-size:1.125rem;' class='text-slate-900 dark:text-white'>2(x − 5)</span></div></div><div class='bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/30 p-3 rounded-lg'><p class='text-lg'>“La mitad de la suma de un número y ocho”</p><div style='margin:0.75rem 0;text-align:center;'><span style='display:inline-block;background-color:rgba(245,158,11,0.2);border:1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.5);border-radius:0.375rem;padding:0.5rem 1rem;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-weight:600;font-size:1.125rem;' class='text-slate-900 dark:text-white'>(x + 8) / 2</span></div></div></div>"
    },
    {
      "tipo": "contenido",
      "titulo": "Lenguaje algebraico: el signo igual",
      "html": "<p class='text-lg'>El signo = se lee “es igual a” o “tiene el mismo valor que”. Compara las expresiones que aparecen a ambos lados: no significa que “la respuesta viene después”. Cada lado se llama miembro de la igualdad, y la igualdad es verdadera cuando ambos miembros tienen el mismo valor.</p><div class='grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2 my-2'><div class='bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/30 p-3 rounded-lg'><p class='text-lg'>“El triple de x es igual a quince”</p><div style='margin:0.75rem 0;text-align:center;'><span style='display:inline-block;background-color:rgba(245,158,11,0.2);border:1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.5);border-radius:0.375rem;padding:0.5rem 1rem;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-weight:600;font-size:1.125rem;' class='text-slate-900 dark:text-white'>3x = 15</span></div></div><div class='bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/30 p-3 rounded-lg'><p class='text-lg'>“La suma de x y cuatro equivale a diez”</p><div style='margin:0.75rem 0;text-align:center;'><span style='display:inline-block;background-color:rgba(245,158,11,0.2);border:1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.5);border-radius:0.375rem;padding:0.5rem 1rem;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-weight:600;font-size:1.125rem;' class='text-slate-900 dark:text-white'>x + 4 = 10</span></div></div></div><p class='text-lg'>Una expresión como x + 4 no afirma una igualdad; al escribir x + 4 = 10 se plantea una ecuación que solo se cumple para ciertos valores de x.</p>"
    },
